# Bhai Sajid ka Hisaab

Android app for managing sweets and bakery shop inventory, sales, cash, and accounts.

## Main Features

* Item search and stock management
* Stock IN and OUT entries
* Automatic remaining stock calculation
* Separate product variants and company-wise stock
* Sales bills and daily sales totals
* Purchase cost, selling price, and profit tracking
* Cash IN and OUT records
* Daily and monthly reports
* Stock wastage, samples, and returns
* Bhai Sajid ledger and payment records
* Low-stock and expiry alerts
* Backup and restore support

## Platform

Android

